      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 026 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My Sister’s Hobby"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My sister likes all kinds of animals. In fact, she has a dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She also loves to listen to music"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and talk to her friends on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She is more talkative than my mother."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My family is always happy, and we are very close to one another,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "which helps me really understand the importance of family."
    },
